---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="How AMI Works" description="How AMI works in 60 seconds." lang="en">
  <section class="section hero compact-hero how-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">The AMI Experience</p>
    <h1>Precision engineering for metabolic navigation.</h1>
    <p class="lede">AMI maps weight, fasting, daily metrics, and wellness-oriented metabolic estimates into one adaptive route. Navigation guides daily decisions; Precision Calibration uses labs to tune your fasting window, coach intensity, and route direction. You set the pace.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid">
    <article class="card highlight"><p class="eyebrow">Applied engineering</p><h2>A system for metabolic direction.</h2><p>AMI organizes signals such as weight, energy, fasting consistency, and wellness-oriented metabolic estimates into a trajectory you can act on — without promising outcomes.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Adaptive model</p><h2>How does it work?</h2><p>It connects profile, habits, fasting, and daily metrics. When labs are available in Precision Calibration, they increase resolution.</p></article>
    <article class="card blue-card"><p class="eyebrow">Decision quality</p><h2>What do you see?</h2><p>A first metabolic route, more context, and a clearer next step — trajectory, not a guaranteed result.</p></article>
  </section>

  <section class="section grid">
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Start</p><h2>Start with what you have.</h2><p>Your profile, habits, fasting behavior, and current context create the starting point.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Daily context</p><h2>Add five seconds of context.</h2><p>One useful metric helps AMI understand how your day is moving.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Coach</p><h2>Receive guidance.</h2><p>The coach translates the pattern into a clear next step. AMI navigates; it does not impose.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Precision</p><h2>Calibrate when labs matter.</h2><p>When you want deeper precision, labs help tune the window, coach intensity, and direction of the route.</p></article>
    <article class="card highlight"><p class="eyebrow">Return</p><h2>Navigate again.</h2><p>Return to daily guidance with more context and a sharper direction.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
